Explosive Steam Engine vapour now lingers for 5 turns.

Each turn, bleeding foes inside the cloud will take [50, 67, 80, 92, 102 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] fire damage.

Any steamtech-using creature will also regenerate [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] additional steam per turn while inside the cloud.

Damage scales with your Steampower.

''Modern technology at the service of burnination!''
